ge of variables formula\n\n$$\n\\iiint_R f(x,y,z)\\,dV=\\iiint_Δ f(x(u,v,w),y(u,v,w),z(u,v,w))\\left|\\frac{\\partial(x,y,z)}{\\partial(u,v,w)}\\right|\\,du\\,dv\\,dw\n$$\n\nwhere $\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)}$ is the Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T.$\n\nNote that the change of variables\n\n$$\nu=x + y,\\quad v=x - y,\\quad w=\\sqrt{z}\n$$\n\ngives us the *inverse* function ${T}^{-1}$.\n\n$$\nT^{-1}:(x,y,z)\\longmapsto (u(x,y,z),v(x,y,z),w(x,y,z)).\n$$\n\nTo find the required integral, we proceed in four steps:\n\n**Step 1**: Find $Δ,$ which is the image of $R$ under the action of ${T}^{-1}.$\n\nOur domain in the $uvw$-space is\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v,w): 1\\le u\\le 4,\\quad 1\\le v\\le 4,\\quad 1\\le w\\le \\sqrt{u v}\\}.\n$$\n\n**Step 2**: Compute the Jacobian determinant corresponding to ${T}^{-1}:$\n\nThe Jacobian determinant corresponding to ${T}^{-1}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(u,v,w)}{∂(x,y,z)} &=\\begin{vmatrix}\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial x} & \\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial y} & \\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial z}\\\\\\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial x} & \\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial y} & \\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial z}\\\\\\frac{\\partial w}{\\partial x} & \\frac{\\partial w}{\\partial y} & \\frac{\\partial w}{\\partial z}\\end{vmatrix}\\\\ &=\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 1 & 0\\\\1 & -1 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{z}}\\end{vmatrix}\\\\ &=(1)\\begin{vmatrix}-1 & 0\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{z}}\\end{vmatrix}-(1)\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 0\\\\0 & \\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{z}}\\end{vmatrix}+(0)\\begin{vmatrix}1 & -1\\\\0 & 0\\end{vmatrix}\\\\ &=- \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{z}}\\\\ &=- \\frac{1}{w}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 3**: Compute the Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T:$\n\nThe Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)}=\\left(\\frac{∂(u,v,w)}{∂(x,y,z)}\\right)^{-1}=- w.\n$$\n\nNote that $\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)}\\ne 0$ everywhere inside $Δ.$ In other words, $T$ has no critical points inside $Δ.$ Since $z\\ge1$ and $w=\\sqrt z$, the branch is $w>0$.\n\n**Step 4**: Perform the change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\iiint_R 4 \\sqrt{z}\\,dV &=\\iiint_Δ \\left(4 w\\right)\\left|\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)}\\right|\\,du\\,dv\\,dw\\\\ &=\\iiint_Δ \\left(4 w\\right)\\left|- w\\right|\\,du\\,dv\\,dw\\\\ &=\\int_{1}^{4}\\int_{1}^{4}\\int_{1}^{\\sqrt{u v}}\\left(4 w^{2}\\right)\\,dw\\,dv\\,du.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558774 1075 #edb/ref 17592186558767 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558774 1075 #edb/ref 17592186558770 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558774 1075 #edb/ref 17592186558789 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558774 1075 #edb/ref 17592186558790 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558774 1075 #edb/ref 17592186558794 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558774 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558774 1077 "selection" 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558774 1078 #edb/ref 17592186558789 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558774 1079 #uuid "2b93097b-db4a-5d04-a26f-2558e108a845" 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558775 1075 #edb/ref 17592186558768 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558775 1075 #edb/ref 17592186558776 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558775 1075 #edb/ref 17592186558778 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558775 1075 #edb/ref 17592186558784 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558775 1075 #edb/ref 17592186558806 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558775 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558775 1077 "selection" 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558775 1078 #edb/ref 17592186558768 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558775 1079 #uuid "2cb431a1-e3de-516b-9ca4-9afe0bfddacf" 13194139536025 17592186045443 true] [17592186558776 1080 "\\int_{1}^{2}\\int_{1}^{2}\\int_{0}^{12}\\left(\\frac{u}{2} + \\frac{3 w}{4}\\ri